{"id":"51cb6796716e54e8","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-leftshift.md","title":"Left-shifts and regular functions with a fixed variable order","display":"df-leftshift — Left-shifts and regular functions with a fixed variable order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-leftshift","aliases":["27-df-leftshift"],"display":"df-leftshift — Left-shifts and regular functions with a fixed variable order","depends_on":["[[27-df-regular]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§8.3 Definition 8.4; §8.1 fixed strength order","source_statement":"Left-shifts and regular functions with a fixed variable order","source_printed_pages":"363;354","source_pdf_pages":"387;378","verification_status":"source-definition-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-leftshift"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-leftshift</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-leftshift — Left-shifts and regular functions with a fixed variable order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" href=\"?note=6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" title=\"27-df-regular\">27-df-regular</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.3 Definition 8.4; §8.1 fixed strength order"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"51cb6796716e54e8\" href=\"?note=51cb6796716e54e8\" title=\"Left-shifts and regular functions with a fixed variable order\">Left-shifts and regular functions with a fixed variable order</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"363;354"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"387;378"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=[n]\">\\(N=[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\)</span> 与变量强度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\succeq_f\">\\(\\succeq_f\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" href=\"?note=6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" title=\"27-df-regular\">27-df-regular</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}(a)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in N:a_i=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{supp}(a)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in N:a_i=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\lhd_n b\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\sigma:\\operatorname{supp}(b)\\to\\operatorname{supp}(a)\\;\\left(\\forall i,j\\in\\operatorname{supp}(b)\\;(\\sigma(i)=\\sigma(j)\\Rightarrow i=j)\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{supp}(b)\\;(\\sigma(i)\\leq i)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\lhd_n b\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\sigma:\\operatorname{supp}(b)\\to\\operatorname{supp}(a)\\;\\left(\\forall i,j\\in\\operatorname{supp}(b)\\;(\\sigma(i)=\\sigma(j)\\Rightarrow i=j)\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{supp}(b)\\;(\\sigma(i)\\leq i)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n:\\forall i,j\\in N\\;(i&lt;j\\Rightarrow i\\succeq_f j)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n:\\forall i,j\\in N\\;(i&lt;j\\Rightarrow i\\succeq_f j)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>a◁b 表示 a 是 b 的左移，允许额外增加1。RegOrd 固定 x1≥强度…≥xn，区别于允许重新排列变量的 Regular。空支持之间唯一空映射可作见证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-regular","status":"resolved","id":"6ae49270bb9c0b4f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-regular]]","embed":false},{"target":"Left-shifts and regular functions with a fixed variable order","status":"resolved","id":"51cb6796716e54e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · source_statement","heading":"","excerpt":"[[Left-shifts and regular functions with a fixed variable order]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-regular","status":"resolved","id":"6ae49270bb9c0b4f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=[n]$，$a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n$；$\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$ 与变量强度 $\\succeq_f$ 见 [[27-df-regular]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"N=[n]","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Monotone}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\succeq_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{supp}(a)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in N:a_i=1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"a\\lhd_n b\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\sigma:\\operatorname{supp}(b)\\to\\operatorname{supp}(a)\\;\\left(\\forall i,j\\in\\operatorname{supp}(b)\\;(\\sigma(i)=\\sigma(j)\\Rightarrow i=j)\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{supp}(b)\\;(\\sigma(i)\\leq i)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n:\\forall i,j\\in N\\;(i<j\\Rightarrow i\\succeq_f j)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1587,"backlinks":[{"id":"16575f999d76012f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B$；$\\lhd_n$ 见 [[27-df-leftshift]]。"},{"id":"0658179ede609361","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B$；$\\lhd_n,\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n$ 见 [[27-df-leftshift]]。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-leftshift|df-leftshift — Left-shifts and regular functions with a fixed variable order]]"},{"id":"f42749f172754927","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}$，$f\\in\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n$，$\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=1)$；见 [[27-df-leftshift]]。$\\chi_A,\\mathcal M(f)$ 见 [[27-df-minmaxsupport]]。$m=|\\mathcal M(f)|\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$Y:[m]\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\{\\chi_A:A\\in\\mathcal M(f)\\}$，$Y^i=Y(i)$，$\\forall r,s\\in[m]\\;(r<s\\Rightarrow\\exists k\\in[n]\\;(Y^r_k<Y^s_k\\land\\forall t\\in[n]\\;(t<k\\Rightarrow Y^r_t=Y^s_t)))$。"},{"id":"3151ee606f4c95e6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n$，$f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B$；$\\lhd_n$、$\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n$ 见 [[27-df-leftshift]]。"}],"outgoing":["6ae49270bb9c0b4f"]}